# FreeLinX/ports - net/netcat : minimal POSIX sh netcat.
#
# NOT fetched from any upstream. FreeLinX-original POSIX sh implementation of
# netcat(1). Provides basic TCP/UDP connectivity for scripting. Upstream
# netcat implementations (OpenBSD netcat, nmap-ncat) failed to download or
# are too complex for the current FreeLinX toolchain. This is a stopgap
# providing basic TCP client functionality using shell builtins.
#
# No DISTINFO_URL/DISTINFO_SHA256: there is no upstream archive to fetch.
